  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Accelerating the uptake of affordable Solar Home Systems in the Matam, Tambacounda and K&#xe9;dougou regions of Senegal</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">VITALITE Senegal is a company whose mission is to improve the living conditions of low-income households by making quality products, services and renewable energies accessible.VITALITE Senegal was created in 2018 as a merger from the Senegalese company S&#xe9;n&#xe9;rgie with the Vitalite group.Under the SDG7 Results facility, the company aims to provide rural households in the remote Eastern provinces of Senegal with basic access to electricity.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Vitalite plans to reach 5.000 households in rural Senegal within four years.</narrative>
  </description>
